            "notes": "here we take [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c), where doing damage is often rewarded. but, please do not frontline with the nasty combo of [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c)+[Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c), it's not worth it. always stay near a support or a tank, never by yourself unless you KNOW you can take a 1v1.\n\n[Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) is reallllly good for damage, which damage procs [Enlightenment](item_8392e752-ca6b-487d-9580-11eab6075c3c), meaning you get good healing out of damage. if you don't have enough money for [Haste Subroutine](item_be06e8c1-baa4-4c24-ae40-c103c45ea0c3) and [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6), keep [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and buy [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) and [Aftermarket Firing Pin](item_2485b212-b286-42d0-a2bd-20eb4396b054). \n\nif you're having trouble surviving against hitscan or any weapon based damage, get [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) and [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09). \n\nif you're struggling against ability based damage, get [Vishkar Condensor](item_086a91da-b65d-4047-8fc7-28a992078b1d) and [Reinforced Titanium](item_8ebaa7db-aedf-48ed-adc1-318cb46a3214). if you've got a lot of money but still struggling to survive, [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) is good paired with [Inner Peace](item_3cb26943-7c02-4aa2-97d0-7411dac1073c). but if the enemy has a lot of burst, [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) is better. [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) can also be a great option for the lifesteal.",
