            "notes": "i usually take [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a) for the adaptability for getting myself out of ults and stuff without completely wasting my entire ult. [Gotta Have Faith](item_b1c30cfc-b920-4d1e-91f3-98c16ca0c3d7) if you didn't take it round 3 and need it for your diving teammates. [Flying Kick](item_e86d8d81-7113-4fc8-b3af-d6e925488a44) if you find yourself taking 1v1s but then need to get out. [Instant Karma](item_7a1cb409-3f6d-424f-882f-729c59476130) if you're having issues dealing with divers 1v1ing you.\n\n\nas far as items, i usually just take whatever seems more fitting. lately i've been doing [Iridescent Iris](item_b7fb28ef-ce82-416b-8693-01c274f8df4e) if i take [Soul Control](item_051aca60-1044-4184-bbbf-5aad8b12592a), but if i want more damage i take [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) or [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b). feel free to do whatever!",
